  "source_groundedness": 0.78,
  "rationale": "The added columns form a well-chosen set of distinct thematic axes (plot, acting, visuals, pacing, emotion, entertainment, originality) that directly serve the query of contrasting themes across positive/negative sentiment; each gives a genuine grouping dimension rather than a trivial restatement, and the recurring not_present option is used honestly for silent rows. Groundedness is generally sound for explicit cues, but the operator repeatedly asserts specific negative categorizations (slow_dragging, superficial_manipulative, familiar_derivative) on rows whose excerpts do not support them, particularly on short plot-summary reviews like IMDB-0005 and the sexploitation review IMDB-0004, indicating a tendency to over-commit where the text is silent."
